      "source": "M6 14 T (the owner, 2026-11-11: carry health tinctures): Ludora the Healer 2229 of Dryreach, landblock_instance guid 0x7DA75026 at (177.166, 78.3451, 18.005) in landblock 0xDA75, outdoors (the row stores cell 0; the cell is the point's, x/24*8 + y/24 + 1 = 0x3C); her create list (destination 4) holds the Health Tincture 27319 (BoostValue 50 on Health, Value 500, burden 50) and her SellPrice is 1.55: 775 pyreals (max(1, ceil(1.55 x 500 - 0.1))); SELECTs on the world copy. Thelnoth of Holtburg does not sell it. The stop is made on the way out, from the Town Network (network-to-dryreach drops 48.8 m from her, dryreach-to-network stands 59.9 m from her: travel-routes.json). keep 12, trip_under 6: with a pack on her (8 to 11.6 health a second, 2026-11-11) a tincture a drink of 2.5 s is 20 health a second, the one drink that out-heals it; a stand of 20 to 30 s takes about 6, so the keep is two stands and the trip line one. The walk from the drop to her is not walked live yet (TODO(m6-town-stock-live))."
