      "source": "M6 14 T (the owner, 2026-11-11: Mana Tinctures too): Ludora's create list (destination 4) holds the Mana Tincture 27322 (BoostValue 50 on Mana, Value 500, burden 50): 775 pyreals at her SellPrice 1.55; a SELECT on the world copy. It is the main mana drink while held (ManaDrinks: the biggest drink that fits whole in the missing mana). keep 30, trip_under 10: the Tusker Cave drank about 4,000 mana an hour on 2026-11-11 between trips about 35 minutes apart, 2,333 mana a stretch; 30 tinctures are 1,500 mana and the 100 Mana Potions of the home walk 2,500, so the two cover a stretch and two thirds of the next, and the potions alone still cover one when the stop fails or the purse holds it back. The burden: 30 x 50 + 100 x 15 + 12 x 50 + 30 x 15 = 4,050 for the four drinks."
