e ring by sight. No pulls: no tusk carrier stands here (the Female Tusk errand is tusker-burrow's). No corpse_fetch section: no cell is quiet, the arrival room itself sees slots 16 (Male Tusker, 0x5C49012A) and 19 (Female Tusker, 0x5C49013C) within 24 m, so a corpse's coin is never fetched here (CorpseCoinRule.Safe)"
